        "contenuto_esteso": "Sen. Cory Booker (D-N.J.), who is eyeing a potential presidential run in 2028, said on Sunday that the Democratic Party “has failed this moment” by not embracing a political vision that transcends traditional party lines and the left-versus-right divide. Booker made his comment during an interview with NBC’s “Meet the Press” when asked about his..."
